	'k0107a6d2' => 'Rosa Delgado is our Lead Instructor in Moving and Handling, possessing fifteen years of practical care and ergonomic training experience. Rosa conducts our intensive practical laboratory sessions, teaching students how to protect their own posture while ensuring resident comfort during transfers. Mei-Lin Tsai serves as Lead Instructor in Dementia Care, bringing fourteen years of residential dementia leadership.',
	'k01cc2a6d' => 'The Core Care Certificate is an institutional certificate awarded directly by Mimamori College. It verifies that you have completed thirty-two weeks of rigorous training and 420 supervised placement hours. Please note that legal registration and licensing requirements for healthcare workers vary significantly by country, state, and local jurisdiction.',
