	'k0e18919e' => '420 hours',
	'k0e557719' => 'Certification and Registration Status',
	'k0fe957ad' => 'Founded 2009',
	'k0ffc0343' => 'The ten-week Dementia Care Certificate costs $1,480, and the two-day Safe Moving and Handling workshop costs $320. Uniform and kit costs $180 for the Core and Evening routes only. Application to any program is entirely free, and our staff are available to help you choose the right path.',
	'k109d10c3' => 'Partner care homes',
	'k124ddde0' => 'Working alongside his named mentor at The Orchards, Joel learned how to maintain professional boundaries while offering warmth and humor. He credits the constant supervision of Samuel Adeyemi for helping him develop adult workplace maturity and pride.',
