	'k1a703e4b' => 'Course Comparison and Fees',
	'k1af2803f' => 'Joel Mensah: Starting at 19',
	'k1d427ba0' => 'Our office is open Monday through Friday from 08:30 to 17:30. During active academic terms, our reception is also open on Saturdays from 09:00 to 12:00. Our administrative staff are on hand to answer questions regarding course availability, application deadlines, and bursary guidelines.',
	'k1e8a5b4f' => 'Registration status',
	'k1f1042bd' => 'During the admissions process, we assess several basic requirements rather than academic test scores. We confirm that you are at least eighteen years of age and legally eligible to study in our jurisdiction. We ask about your physical ability to perform manual handling, including standing, bending, and assisting individuals with transfers.',
	'k204495a3' => 'College Bursaries and Terms',
