	'k218dcec3' => 'Tuition is $1,150, which covers all practice room equipment and learning materials. There is no compulsory placement component, making it easy to balance with current responsibilities while restoring your practical confidence in a supportive setting.',
	'k23aa6862' => 'Learner Support',
	'k23ed4051' => 'Tuition is $7,200, plus the $180 uniform and kit fee. Payment can be divided across four interest-free instalments. Cohorts start on 12 January and follow the same rigorous assessment standards as the day program.',
	'k23f0cd54' => 'Return to Care is a focused six-week part-time refresher course for former care workers seeking to re-enter the field. If you have been away from care practice, this course updates your understanding of modern moving and handling techniques, current documentation standards, and evolving equipment. The program runs two half-days per week at our Lindmere campus.',
	'k241c0ea8' => 'To assist students in managing educational expenses, Mimamori College provides an interest-free instalment plan for both the Core Care Certificate and the Evening Route. Tuition is divided into four equal payments spread evenly across the duration of the program. The first instalment is due upon formal enrolment to secure your seat in the intake.',
