	'k3178d893' => 'We begin from the absolute fundamentals of dignity, posture, and communication. In our Lindmere practice room, you learn how to support another person safely before you ever enter a residential setting. Changing careers can feel daunting, but our small group ratio of one instructor to eight students ensures you are guided at every stage.',
	'k31d06bad' => 'In Weeks 9 through 28, students attend three college days and two placement days each week, totaling 280 hours. Finally, Weeks 29 through 32 comprise four full weeks on the floor, providing 140 hours of continuous shift experience alongside their mentor. This progressive structure ensures confidence builds steadily without sudden, unsupported leaps.',
