	'k38f777ba' => 'after years raising family or working elsewhere requires only structured space to rebuild confidence. Our refresher training brings your practical skills up to date, reconnecting your natural empathy with current safe transfer techniques and modern care protocols.',
	'k39453172' => 'Noor Haddad, former bank teller',
	'k39a6839b' => 'Ingrid Halvorsen serves as Principal of Mimamori College, bringing over twenty-two years of experience in healthcare management and adult education. She founded the college curriculum to ensure foundational care is taught with dignity and practical discipline. Samuel Adeyemi is our Director of Practice, with eighteen years in elderly residential care and clinical governance.',
