	'k3add9600' => 'Tuition fees at Mimamori College cover all instructional costs, practical laboratory access, and placement support. Specifically, fees include all classroom teaching, small-group practice room training with our 1:8 instructor ratio, and continuous clinical assessment. They also cover placement coordination across our twenty-two partner homes and regular mentor monitoring by Aisha Rahman.',
