	'k578b6495' => 'At 15:00, the group convenes for daily review. Instructors review what went well and identify specific movements to repeat tomorrow. The day concludes at 15:30, allowing students to travel home without evening study stress, prepared for the next morning.',
	'k5983f1aa' => 'Tuition for the full-time 32-week Core Care Certificate is $6,800. The 48-week Evening Route is $7,200. Both certificate programs require a one-off uniform and kit fee of $180, which covers standard tunics, practical training gear, and learning materials. Our six-week Return to Care refresher course costs $1,150.',
	'k59917664' => 'The 32-week Core Care Certificate is structured into three progressive stages. During Weeks 1 through 8, training takes place entirely at the college. No student assists a real resident until instructors sign off their moving and handling competence.',
	'k5a1bf5f6' => 'Once you decide to apply, you complete our standard online or paper application form. Applying is completely free of charge. The application asks for your personal contact details, educational history, work experience, and the names of two verifiable references.',
